{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/desc_header_build.png?t=1753431904\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit heroes with unique skills and place them strategically on the field. Merge the same characters to level them up and get access to more powerful skills. Optimize your team and create strong synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/buy_level_up_blue_bg.gif?t=1753431904\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/desc_header_fight.png?t=1753431904\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the battle starts, your characters will fight automatically and use their skills. Where they are on the battlefield determines the order of attacks and skills. Status effects like armor, poison, or bleeding make the combat even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/fight.gif?t=1753431904\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405540/extras/desc_header_customize.png?t=1753431904\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win battles to earn Unlock Tokens! Use these tokens to get new characters and add them to your custom deck. Find unexpected combinations and perfect your strategy. Share your decks with the community and friends \u2012 and try out their creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div clas